abstract: >-
  Streaming exact-guide counting from FASTQ using either an anchor-bounded
  workflow or the supplied full-adapter count-flex workflow, plus a Pandas API,
  optional orientation detection, anchor substitutions, and descriptive library QC.
  The stable scope is counting/QC. Legacy statistical hit callers remain experimental.
